hostapd: relay 802.11k Radio Measurement action frames to the CAP

A station's beacon report is an action frame (category 5).  The CAP's manager
wants to see it, so notify the external RSN relay the same way as an
Auth/AssocReq; the frame is then reported as 0x2018.

--- a/src/ap/ieee802_11.c
+++ b/src/ap/ieee802_11.c
@@ -6380,5 +6380,16 @@
 	case WLAN_FC_STYPE_ACTION:
 		wpa_printf(MSG_DEBUG, "mgmt::action");
+#ifdef CONFIG_EXTERNAL_RSN_AUTH
+		/*
+		 * 802.11k: a station's beacon report is a Radio Measurement
+		 * action frame (category 5).  Relay it to the manager like an
+		 * Auth/AssocReq so it can act on it.
+		 */
+		if (hapd->conf->external_rsn_auth && len > 25 &&
+		    mgmt->u.action.category == WLAN_ACTION_RADIO_MEASUREMENT)
+			ext_auth_notify_assocreq(hapd, mgmt->sa,
+					 (const u8 *) mgmt, len);
+#endif /* CONFIG_EXTERNAL_RSN_AUTH */
 		ret = handle_action(hapd, mgmt, len, freq);
 		break;
 	default:
